{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AnyFieldApi = FieldApi<any, any, any, any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FieldApi/FieldApi.public.ts#L74","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FieldApi/FieldApi.public.ts:74"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A field API whose field name, value, error, and owning form types are erased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it for reusable helpers that only need members shared by every field,\nsuch as a generic error display. Because value and update types are erased,\nprefer "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FieldWithValue<TFieldValue>"},{"type":"text","value":" when a helper reads or changes a field\nvalue."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function getFieldErrorText(field: AnyFieldApi) {\n  if (field.meta.isValid) return ''\n\n  return field.errors.map((error) => error.message).join(', ')\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AnyFieldApi = FieldApi<any, any, any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FieldApi/FieldApi.public.ts:74](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FieldApi/FieldApi.public.ts#L74)\n\nA field API whose field name, value, error, and owning form types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable helpers that only need members shared by every field,\nsuch as a generic error display. Because value and update types are erased,\nprefer `FieldWithValue<TFieldValue>` when a helper reads or changes a field\nvalue.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nfunction getFieldErrorText(field: AnyFieldApi) {\n  if (field.meta.isValid) return ''\n\n  return field.errors.map((error) => error.message).join(', ')\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AnyFieldApi\ntitle: AnyFieldApi\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AnyFieldApi = FieldApi<any, any, any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FieldApi/FieldApi.public.ts:74](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FieldApi/FieldApi.public.ts#L74)\n\nA field API whose field name, value, error, and owning form types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable helpers that only need members shared by every field,\nsuch as a generic error display. Because value and update types are erased,\nprefer `FieldWithValue<TFieldValue>` when a helper reads or changes a field\nvalue.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nfunction getFieldErrorText(field: AnyFieldApi) {\n  if (field.meta.isValid) return ''\n\n  return field.errors.map((error) => error.message).join(', ')\n}\n```\n"}
